@startuml
!theme plain
title Learning Lab — system context (repository-grounded)

actor Operator
folder "Company data\nfiles / workbooks / tables" as CompanyData

rectangle "Learning Lab — live system" as Live {
  component "adapters" as Adapters
  component "inspector" as Inspector
  component "modeller" as Modeller
  component "taskmodel" as TaskModel
  component "task families\nreservation / enrichment /\naggregation / reconciliation" as Families
  component "worker" as Worker
  component "fleet + system map" as Fleet
  component "supervisor" as Supervisor
}

folder "Frozen research / evidence estate\nexperiment* / definition_phase / s1..s15 /\nuq1_audit / work_interface packs" as Research

cloud "Agent workspace / Work\n(research hypothesis, not product authority)" as Work

Operator --> Modeller : define / confirm work
Operator --> Fleet : operate / inspect map
Operator --> Supervisor : ask / investigate / review
CompanyData --> Adapters : structural input
Adapters --> Inspector : observable structure/data
Inspector --> Modeller : measured facts / evidence
Modeller --> TaskModel : proposed explicit model
TaskModel --> Families : task-family semantics
Families --> Worker : deterministic execution semantics
Worker --> Fleet : established runs / refusals / effects
Fleet --> Supervisor : read-only operational context
Supervisor ..> Fleet : proposals / investigations\n(no silent production authority)

Work ..> Modeller : proposed definition path
Work ..> Supervisor : consultation path

Research ..> Live : evidence that established current floor

note right of Research
Research is preserved evidence/history,
not an alternate live application path.
end note

note bottom of Work
The Work-interface roadmap is a hypothesis/research contract.
PRODUCT.md remains product authority until that hypothesis is adopted.
end note
@enduml
